  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IAVI 2009 - IAVI2009</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IAVI 2009-2010</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the 11 years since IAVI was founded they have developed more than 54 active R&amp;D relationships and several relationships with NGOs, governments, and multilateral organizations . IAVI has helped to raise the political profile of HIV/AIDS. It has increased the attention of policy makers to the need for an AIDS vaccine that would meet the needs of developing countries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med forskningsst&#xf6;det &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka IAVIs m&#xf6;jligheter att forts&#xe4;tta med sina omfattande kraftanstr&#xe4;ngningar f&#xf6;r att f&#xe5; fram vaccin mot HIV. IAVI har skapat partnerskap och samarbetar p&#xe5; olika niv&#xe5;er med forskare, andra organisationer, n&#xe4;ringsliv, universitet samt regeringsinstitutioner. IAVI l&#xe4;gger stor kraft vid att finna en immunogen som har f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;gan att stimulera ett humoralt immunsvar.</narrative>
  </description>
